# Static artifact host (bee — glen/gloo HTML pages, diagrams, mockups).
# artifacts-server.service (hosts/bee/artifacts.nix) binds bee's Nebula IP
# 10.10.0.12:8910, serving ~/artifacts: files, folders, generated catalog
# (index.html + manifest.json), /assets vendored fonts+mermaid, and a small
# JSON API (POST /-/delete, /-/reindex) for the catalog page.
# Publish flow: dsh `artifacts` skill / `publish-artifact <file-or-dir>
# [slug]` on bee, then share https://artifacts.internal.crussell.io/<slug>.

@artifacts host artifacts.internal.crussell.io
handle @artifacts {
    reverse_proxy 10.10.0.12:8910
}
